## Precompressed copies, conditional requests, byte ranges, HEAD

$ curl -H Accept-Encoding: gzip https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 200 
  bareproxy-id: 0bf08077709bd288
  content-encoding: gzip
  content-type: text/html; charset=utf-8
  etag: "18db9cdeadbdc229-df3-gz"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -H If-None-Match: "18db9cdeadbdc229-53eb" https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
HTTP/2 304 
  bareproxy-id: 37f38bc85c15b454
  etag: "18db9cdeadbdc229-53eb"
  vary: Accept-Encoding

$ curl -r 0-99 https://bareproxy.com:8443/images/plan-demo.png
HTTP/2 206 
  bareproxy-id: 3e0a263d13c73061
  content-range: bytes 0-99/71088
  content-type: image/png
  etag: "18db927ad0ffe200-115b0"

$ curl -I https://bareproxy.com:8443/about/
