## Reload with a broken config: the running version keeps serving
bareproxy: 2026/10/05 13:55:59 pool api: 127.0.0.1:9083 down after 3 failed checks (connect refused)
bareproxy: 2026/10/05 13:56:04 pool api: 127.0.0.1:9082 down after 3 failed checks (connect refused)
bareproxy: 2026/10/05 13:56:05 reload: live.conf can't go live (the config has errors, so nothing changed; line 10: error: no pool named apix; line 13: warning: pool api isn't used by any route), so version 1 keeps running

$ curl https://bareproxy.com:8443/platform/
